# L7n genre-only beds. Directive list: AGENTS.md, section "Layer checks".
# A preset button plays the genre base. The groove is that genre's own grid.
# A theme that declares states still lists those states.

name: hip-hop resolve keeps its loop and its palette
args: theme resolve --genre hiphop --seed 1
exit: 0
stdout-contains: harmony.style=loop
stdout-contains: instruments.lead=lead.saw
stdout-contains: instruments.bass=bass.synth
stdout-contains: instruments.drums=drums.808
stdout-not-contains: from=state:

---
name: rock resolve keeps its flat-seven loop
args: theme resolve --genre rock --seed 1
exit: 0
stdout-contains: harmony.style=modal
stdout-contains: instruments.lead=guitar.overdrive
stdout-contains: instruments.bass=bass.finger
stdout-regex: harmony\.progression=I,(bVII,IV,I|bVII,V,I|V,bVII,I)

---
name: fantasy resolve keeps the minor-functional draw
args: theme resolve --genre fantasy --seed 1
exit: 0
stdout-contains: source=generated:markov(minor-functional)
stdout-contains: instruments.lead=flute
stdout-contains: instruments.pad=strings
stdout-contains: instruments.bass=cello

---
name: hip-hop genre render
args: render --genre hiphop --bars 2 --seed 1 --out build/l7n-hip --formats events
exit: 0
delete-before: build/l7n-hip
stdout-contains: states= transitions=
stdout-not-contains: peaceful
file-exists: build/l7n-hip/events.jsonl

---
name: rock genre render
args: render --genre rock --bars 2 --seed 1 --out build/l7n-rock --formats events
exit: 0
delete-before: build/l7n-rock
stdout-contains: states= transitions=
file-exists: build/l7n-rock/events.jsonl

---
name: fantasy genre render
args: render --genre fantasy --bars 2 --seed 1 --out build/l7n-fan --formats events
exit: 0
delete-before: build/l7n-fan
stdout-contains: states= transitions=
file-exists: build/l7n-fan/events.jsonl

---
name: hip-hop clap sits on beat 3
args: describe-music build/l7n-hip/events.jsonl --roll --bars 1
exit: 0
stdout-contains: snare |········●·······

---
name: rock snare is the backbeat
args: describe-music build/l7n-rock/events.jsonl --roll --bars 1
exit: 0
stdout-contains: snare |····●·······●···

---
name: fantasy genre has no kit
args: describe-music build/l7n-fan/events.jsonl --roll --bars 1
exit: 0
stdout-not-contains: snare |

---
name: hip-hop does not hold a pad
args: debug inspect build/l7n-hip/events.jsonl --where layer=pad
exit: 0
stdout-empty

---
name: hip-hop chords are a stab
args: debug inspect build/l7n-hip/events.jsonl --where layer=chords
exit: 0
stdout-contains: dur=1/8
stdout-not-contains: dur=1/1

---
name: fantasy strings hold and the piano does not
args: debug inspect build/l7n-fan/events.jsonl --where layer=pad
exit: 0
stdout-contains: dur=1/1

---
name: fantasy piano is not a second held pad
args: debug inspect build/l7n-fan/events.jsonl --where layer=chords
exit: 0
stdout-contains: dur=1/4
stdout-not-contains: dur=1/1

---
name: the three leads do not share one cell
args: debug inspect build/l7n-hip/events.jsonl --where layer=lead
exit: 0
stdout-contains: dur=480/3840
stdout-contains: dur=1920/3840

---
name: rock lead is quarters
args: debug inspect build/l7n-rock/events.jsonl --where layer=lead
exit: 0
stdout-contains: dur=960/3840
stdout-not-contains: dur=480/3840
stdout-not-contains: dur=1440/3840

---
name: fantasy lead uses the dotted cell
args: debug inspect build/l7n-fan/events.jsonl --where layer=lead
exit: 0
stdout-contains: dur=1440/3840

---
name: a genre-only lead was not picked by the critic
args: debug explain build/l7n-hip/events.jsonl --where layer=lead --first
exit: 0
stdout-not-contains: hook.cand

---
name: rock lead was not picked by the critic
args: debug explain build/l7n-rock/events.jsonl --where layer=lead --first
exit: 0
stdout-not-contains: hook.cand

---
name: the dungeon theme still declares its states
args: theme explain themes/fantasy-dungeon.yaml
exit: 0
stdout-contains: states=peaceful,sneaking,combat,danger,trading,partying
stdout-contains: state=combat

---
name: a declared state still uses the critic
args: render themes/fantasy-dungeon.yaml --seed 1 --bars 1-2 --out build/l7n-dungeon --formats events
exit: 0
delete-before: build/l7n-dungeon
file-exists: build/l7n-dungeon/events.jsonl

---
name: the dungeon lead names the hook
args: debug explain build/l7n-dungeon/events.jsonl --where layer=lead --first
exit: 0
stdout-contains: hook.cand
